AquariusImage
Part of the AquariusDiffusion series (native low-bit text-to-image diffusion)
Copyright 2026 Junyi Du

This product includes components developed by third parties, each used under
its own license:

* Text encoder
  Derived from Qwen3.5-0.8B (language tower, int8-quantized), copyright and
  license terms of its upstream project apply.

* VAE
  Stable Diffusion 1.5 VAE weights (fp16). CreativeML Open RAIL-M terms apply.

* UNet
  Structurally isomorphic to Stable Diffusion 1.5 (Stability AI); trained from
  scratch in this project. Upstream license terms of SD1.5 apply to the
  architectural derivative.

* Training data
  COCO train2017 (COCO Consortium). COCO terms apply.

* AI assistance
  Implementation, data analysis and report drafting were carried out in
  collaboration with the GLM-5.3-Flash (Zhipu Z.ai) and DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
  (DeepSeek AI) large language models.

The model weight files are distributed via GitHub Releases for research
